He passed all the test!

01:17:26.800 --> 01:17:28.880
He lied. We go now.

01:17:29.360 --> 01:17:29.980
Leave the...

01:17:30.000 --> 01:17:38.740
temple. You're one of the Xi clan? My name's Wang Lu. I'm in charge here, for the moment.

01:17:39.500 --> 01:17:49.680
The fact is, our leader has recently died. Well, that's good. Now give me the clan leader's seal.

01:17:50.540 --> 01:17:59.320
Huh? The leader's seal? Right. Lord Xi is dead, and the clans need a leader. What about the rule?

01:18:00.250 --> 01:18:03.470
What about the rules? It's my fist to make the rules.

01:18:04.100 --> 01:18:08.400
But the rules say there has to be a contest to find the leader.

01:18:09.280 --> 01:18:15.060
I tell you, in these last few weeks, all the likely contenders have been killed

01:18:15.720 --> 01:18:19.160
because they've all fallen victim to my seven-fist style.

01:18:20.260 --> 01:18:21.400
Seven-fist style?

01:18:22.290 --> 01:18:28.520
And if you don't give me that seal now, well then, you're going to be just as dead as they are.

01:18:28.900 --> 01:18:29.620
Is that so?

01:18:31.240 --> 01:18:34.580
Neither she is dead, but his daughter is alive.

01:18:35.240 --> 01:18:37.400
And if you want the seal, you'll have to ask me.

01:18:37.930 --> 01:18:49.090
Very pretty indeed.

01:18:51.090 --> 01:18:53.720
But can you protect the seal, though?

01:18:54.580 --> 01:18:55.520
You'll find out.

01:18:55.860 --> 01:18:56.860
You just try and take it.

01:19:59.080 --> 01:19:59.340
Mm-hmm.

01:20:00.410 --> 01:20:06.720
I'm not. What a great bully, fighting a young girl. You're a real creep.

01:20:07.200 --> 01:20:16.320
Why are you here?

01:20:16.960 --> 01:20:17.880
What are you fighting for?

01:20:18.880 --> 01:20:24.650
This man says he wants to be the leader of all the clans here, so he's come here for my father's seal.

01:20:25.310 --> 01:20:25.830
Clan leader?

01:20:31.760 --> 01:20:33.800
You must be Luxan, I guess.

01:20:35.480 --> 01:20:36.400
You want to be leader?

01:20:37.660 --> 01:20:41.030
I tell you, I'm the only man who qualifies for that.

01:20:42.130 --> 01:20:42.590
Who are you?

01:20:43.960 --> 01:20:44.640
Who am I?

01:20:45.520 --> 01:20:52.250
You'll be dead scared when you know I am the genius.

01:20:53.760 --> 01:20:56.690
I am champion of the world.

01:20:57.630 --> 01:20:59.820
You see, I am Lungy Lang.

01:21:00.000 --> 01:21:03.810
Careful, he's very good.

01:21:04.880 --> 01:21:08.140
Oh, hold this. I'll teach him a lesson.

01:21:20.010 --> 01:21:20.590
How's that?

01:21:34.400 --> 01:21:36.980
Can't lock this. It's adjustable.

01:22:00.800 --> 01:22:01.360
Bye-bye.

01:22:45.880 --> 01:22:48.980
Please spare his life. Please don't kill him.

01:22:52.080 --> 01:22:56.680
My son, he's ignorant. So please forgive him this once.

01:22:57.440 --> 01:22:59.840
He brought up a fight.

01:23:00.280 --> 01:23:01.020
He's not bad.

01:23:01.860 --> 01:23:02.380
Yes.

01:23:03.000 --> 01:23:03.520
The seal.

01:23:05.820 --> 01:23:10.450
Well, sir, I realize that you deserve to have the seal.

01:23:11.470 --> 01:23:17.000
But still, the gun will say you must get it only in the Shaolin Temple courtyard.

01:23:17.720 --> 01:23:20.110
Let's meet there in seven days' time.

01:23:20.430 --> 01:23:23.690
In the meantime, I'll arrange with the monks for the proper ceremony.

01:23:27.530 --> 01:23:29.970
I know, as you fight so...

01:23:30.060 --> 01:23:33.950
Well, there's none better. The seal belongs to you.

01:23:34.540 --> 01:23:38.960
So why not wait just a week, and then you will get the seal.

01:23:39.490 --> 01:23:42.360
That's officially, and with honor, too.

01:23:44.160 --> 01:23:49.220
Right, I'll accept that. See you in one week.

01:23:50.170 --> 01:23:51.350
Please, please.

01:23:55.420 --> 01:23:59.220
Teacher, I'm your son, but you're a monk.

01:24:00.220 --> 01:24:02.300
If I hadn't said that, you'd have been dead.

01:24:02.716 --> 01:24:03.856
I could beat him.

01:24:04.056 --> 01:24:04.296
Maybe.

01:24:04.988 --> 01:24:06.228
I wouldn't be too sure.

01:24:06.556 --> 01:24:07.736
He likes pretty good.

01:24:08.028 --> 01:24:09.068
Now off to the temple.

01:24:10.172 --> 01:24:12.272
Except for those monks from our hall.

01:24:13.660 --> 01:24:14.720
You all should leave.

01:24:30.380 --> 01:24:30.880
Well...

01:24:35.404 --> 01:24:36.724
As a Shaolin teacher.

01:24:37.644 --> 01:24:39.724
How could you steal the book from us?

01:24:40.332 --> 01:24:42.892
And then kill the leader of the Wutong clan.

01:24:43.820 --> 01:24:45.460
Both of them hideous crimes.

01:24:46.188 --> 01:24:47.228
Your punishment...

01:24:47.340 --> 01:24:48.680
will be severe.

01:24:50.380 --> 01:24:52.040
I've always kept the rules.

01:24:52.588 --> 01:24:53.588
Faithfully!

01:24:54.444 --> 01:24:55.644
I am innocent.

01:24:56.364 --> 01:24:57.504
Please investigate.

01:24:58.092 --> 01:24:59.272
Find the real comfort.

01:25:00.090 --> 01:25:03.320
So you deny it, but the palm print proves your guilt.

01:25:04.020 --> 01:25:06.390
And if you're innocent, why did you run?

01:25:07.820 --> 01:25:13.620
My father's hardly dead, but this Luxin has already been to my house,

01:25:13.980 --> 01:25:15.160
demanding the leader's seal.

01:25:15.810 --> 01:25:18.900
And my skills are not enough to protect the seal.

01:25:20.450 --> 01:25:23.300
I therefore deliver the seal for your protection.

01:25:24.580 --> 01:25:27.320
Luxin, how old is this person?

01:25:28.330 --> 01:25:29.980
About 30, and he...

01:25:30.476 --> 01:25:31.316
seven-fifths.

01:25:31.916 --> 01:25:32.916
Oh, seven-fifths?

01:25:32.916 --> 01:25:33.916
That's right!

01:25:36.844 --> 01:25:37.844
How are you?

01:25:38.124 --> 01:25:38.584
I am.

01:25:38.764 --> 01:25:39.604
Let's see.

01:25:39.628 --> 01:25:41.628
And as the leader of the clans is dead...

01:25:42.668 --> 01:25:43.868
There has to be a new leader.

01:25:45.132 --> 01:25:46.932
That's why I've come here to take the seal.

01:25:50.156 --> 01:25:50.356
Go ahead.

01:25:51.884 --> 01:25:53.884
But how did he learn the seven fists?

01:25:53.900 --> 01:25:55.860
I think he should be asked that question.

01:25:57.068 --> 01:25:58.088
You were guarding me.

01:25:58.732 --> 01:25:59.632
when it was stolen.

01:26:00.380 --> 01:26:01.380
It was your failure.

01:26:02.844 --> 01:26:04.464
Aren't you ashamed to ask?

01:26:05.692 --> 01:26:06.192
Ha ha ha!

01:26:07.036 --> 01:26:07.536
Habit?

01:26:08.220 --> 01:26:10.300
Great impertinence within our temple.

01:26:11.644 --> 01:26:13.064
What if this should leak out?

01:26:13.532 --> 01:26:14.732
And our reputation.

01:26:15.420 --> 01:26:16.740
could be greatly damaged.

01:26:17.916 --> 01:26:19.336
So we have to be patient.

01:26:20.220 --> 01:26:22.220
My master's already been very patient!

01:26:22.684 --> 01:26:23.964
Giving you plenty of faith.

01:26:24.764 --> 01:26:26.204
And with his kung fu skills...

01:26:26.588 --> 01:26:27.428
Who'd fight it?

01:26:27.996 --> 01:26:29.076
So let's have the seal.

01:26:29.500 --> 01:26:30.000
That's...

01:26:30.730 --> 01:26:33.860
Chief Abbott, this man underestimates Shaolin Temple.

01:26:34.660 --> 01:26:35.800
Let's teach him a lesson.

01:26:37.540 --> 01:26:39.680
Monks have to learn to be very tolerant.

01:26:40.320 --> 01:26:43.700
Well, I'm not a monk. I can't stand it.

01:26:45.000 --> 01:26:46.120
I'm going to teach him a lesson.

01:26:46.240 --> 01:26:48.780
Hey, look, Sin.

01:26:48.920 --> 01:26:50.130
You come here.

01:26:51.080 --> 01:26:52.080
We'll see who's best.

01:26:54.400 --> 01:26:54.640
Shoot.

01:26:54.880 --> 01:26:57.060
I beat you once.

01:26:58.070 --> 01:26:58.390
Remember?

01:26:58.770 --> 01:26:59.980
Ah, you...

01:27:00.000 --> 01:27:02.320
You were just very lucky. Doesn't prove a thing.

01:27:02.844 --> 01:27:05.124
This time, you're not going to win again. I promise.

01:27:05.788 --> 01:27:06.408
So come on.

01:27:30.280 --> 01:27:32.930
What the fuck?

01:28:00.060 --> 01:28:00.300
Oh

01:28:46.960 --> 01:28:55.450
else! Send you to hell!

01:29:04.480 --> 01:29:05.200
How much time is that?

01:29:06.200 --> 01:29:06.780
Come on!

01:29:30.480 --> 01:29:36.270
Prime Style Fist!

01:29:36.920 --> 01:29:38.040
Prime Style Fist?

01:30:03.290 --> 01:30:03.470
Yeah!

01:30:30.000 --> 01:30:30.720
You can't kill him!

01:30:33.100 --> 01:30:56.140
Him or me?

01:31:00.000 --> 01:31:00.880
Hey!

01:31:02.200 --> 01:31:02.580
Hey!

01:31:03.050 --> 01:31:03.370
Hey!

01:31:03.530 --> 01:31:03.710
Hey!

01:31:38.460 --> 01:31:57.960
I know exactly who you are.

01:31:58.670 --> 01:31:59.970
You were the man who wanted to-

01:32:00.060 --> 01:32:06.330
had the clan leadership just 30 years ago. At least you still remember that. With

01:32:06.330 --> 01:32:13.580
my Kung Fu talents, I beat all the other challenges. But you damn Shaolin monks, all

01:32:13.580 --> 01:32:19.340
of you argued. I was too young and so I didn't get the clan leadership. And from

01:32:19.340 --> 01:32:24.790
that time on, I swore revenge. And so you went and changed your name and became a

01:32:24.790 --> 01:32:29.960
junior monk in this temple. Right. And I took your garbage for 30 years.

01:32:30.000 --> 01:32:37.340
years until I could steal that book so that my son could become the leader and so that the name of the

01:32:37.340 --> 01:32:43.760
look family would be known to all men soon as the book was stolen I had my suspicions and then

01:32:43.760 --> 01:32:49.060
when I saw that fake palm print I knew that there was a traitor here but I never thought of you it

01:32:49.430 --> 01:32:56.900
was I killed Lord Xi and Wei Chung as well my father never harmed you he had to die to make way

01:32:56.900 --> 01:32:59.980
for my son, but you were below in the sun.

01:33:01.600 --> 01:33:03.920
There's a tunnel there you don't know about.

01:33:04.530 --> 01:33:05.350
Why Wei Cheng?

01:33:06.200 --> 01:33:10.520
He suspected me. He was checking on me, and so I had to kill him.

01:33:11.280 --> 01:33:12.520
But why frame me, though?

01:33:13.780 --> 01:33:16.300
Well, somebody had to take the blame.

01:33:17.100 --> 01:33:18.970
Well, now you know the truth.

01:33:19.970 --> 01:33:22.310
Now I'll avenge myself and my son.

01:33:22.710 --> 01:33:24.610
I shall kill you all, everyone!

01:33:31.240 --> 01:33:32.850
I killed you, son. Start on me!

01:34:01.564 --> 01:34:03.564
Thank you for watching!

01:34:05.276 --> 01:34:07.276
Thank you for watching!

01:34:08.252 --> 01:34:10.252
Thank you for watching!

01:34:30.000 --> 01:34:30.360
Huuuah!

01:34:30.520 --> 01:34:30.720
Huuuah!

01:34:30.720 --> 01:34:31.260
Huuuah!

01:34:36.650 --> 01:34:37.050
Huuuah!

01:35:03.360 --> 01:35:03.860
Great!

01:35:09.390 --> 01:35:14.220
Hey, hey!

01:35:14.380 --> 01:35:15.780
You're holding me!

01:35:54.630 --> 01:35:57.040
My turn! My turn to beat you!

01:36:00.030 --> 01:36:00.790
Oh

01:36:32.970 --> 01:36:42.200
I got it.

01:37:00.060 --> 01:37:04.460
No, no, no, no.

01:37:31.820 --> 01:37:32.240
I'm going.

01:38:00.000 --> 01:38:00.200
Oh

01:38:30.000 --> 01:38:30.260
Thank you.
